OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,6,     F4/5. Donald Macleod traces Smith's
OL,7,     Fwriting of her Second Symphony for
OL,8,     Fa competition at the Alexandra
OL,9,     FPalace.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FConnor Fogel and tenor Brenden
OL,12,     FGunnell on their latest albums.
OL,13,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,14,     FLive at the BBC Proms: the BBC
OL,15,     FScottish Symphony Orchestra
OL,16,     Fperforms Korngold, Prokofiev and
OL,17,     FTabakova with principal guest
OL,18,     Fconductor Delyana Lazarova and
OL,19,     Fviolinist Alena Baeva.
