OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FThe Amaryllis Quartet has been
OL,7,     Fperforming in major concert halls
OL,8,     Ffor 20 years. In this birthday
OL,9,     Fconcert, chamber music classics by
OL,10,     FBeethoven and Brahms are
OL,11,     Fperformed.
